          <li><span class="tf-dot tf-dot-g"></span>Entry otomatis saat harga masuk zona BR</li>
          <li><span class="tf-dot tf-dot-g"></span>Partial close TP1 / TP2 / TP3</li>
          <li><span class="tf-dot tf-dot-g"></span>Auto Break-Even setelah TP1 hit</li>
          <li><span class="tf-dot tf-dot-g"></span>Filter trend + arah trade (Long/Short/Both)</li>
          <li><span class="tf-dot tf-dot-g"></span>Protected per account number</li>
        </ul>
